:: ScarletBook4
<<set $scarletBook++>>

"라울과 자넷"을 읽고 있다.
<br><br>
The book tells the story of two lovers from the seventeenth century. Raul is the <<worldMale 'son' 'daughter'>> of a poor tailor, but instead of honest work, <<worldMale 'he' 'she'>> prefers to search for adventures. Janet is a young, polite <<worldFemale 'girl' 'boy'>> from a wealthy family and the <<worldFemale 'daughter' 'son'>> of a local <<worldMale 'baron' 'baroness'>> and the ruler of the city. Despite the differences between them, they fall in love with each other, but Janet's <<worldMale 'father' 'mother'>> is against their acquaintanceship, stating that the street <<worldMale 'boy' 'girl'>> is not the right <<worldMale 'fiancé' 'fiancée'>> for <<worldMale 'his' 'her'>> <<worldFemale 'daughter' 'son'>>. One day, Raul convinces <<worldMale 'his' 'her'>> beloved to run away together.
<br><br>
<<if $location is "avery_mansion">>
	<<avery_mansion>>
	<<if $avery_mansion.schedule isnot "away" and $avery_mansion.schedule isnot "work">>
		<<set $_avery_present to true>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<<if $location is "avery_mansion" and ($avery_mansion?.schedule is "study" and !$avery_mansion?.study_unlocked) or ($avery_mansion?.study_unlocked is 1 and Time.hour is 23 and $_avery_present)>>
	As it turns out, the <<worldMale 'baron' 'baroness'>>'s fears were real. When Janet's <<worldMale 'father' 'mother'>> orders <<worldMale 'him' 'her'>> to leave <<worldMale 'his' 'her'>> <<worldFemale 'daughter' 'son'>> alone, the <<worldMale 'boy' 'girl'>> brutally—
	<br><br>

	서재 밖에서 들려오는 발소리에 독서가 중단되고, 누군가 문손잡이를 잡는 소리가 들린다.<<if !$avery_mansion.study_unlocked>> 당신은 재빨리 책을 덮고 숨는다.<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[다음|$scarletExitPassage]]>><<handheldon>><<unset $scarletExitPassage>><</link>>
<<elseif $location is "avery_mansion" and ["return", "party", "party_prepare", "date"].includes($avery_mansion?.schedule)>>
	As it turns out, the <<worldMale 'baron' 'baroness'>>'s fears were real. When Janet's <<worldMale 'father' 'mother'>> orders <<worldMale 'him' 'her'>> to leave <<worldMale 'his' 'her'>> <<worldFemale 'daughter' 'son'>> alone, the <<worldMale 'boy' 'girl'>> brutally—
	<br><br>

	에이버리가 다가오는 소리에 독서가 중단된다.<<if !$avery_mansion.study_unlocked>> 당신은 재빨리 책을 덮고 서재를 나간다.<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[다음|$scarletExitPassage]]>><<handheldon>><<unset $scarletExitPassage>><</link>>
<<else>>
	As it turns out, the <<worldMale 'baron' 'baroness'>>'s fears were real. When Janet's <<worldMale 'father' 'mother'>> orders <<worldMale 'him' 'her'>> to leave <<worldMale 'his' 'her'>> <<worldFemale 'daughter' 'son'>> alone, the <<worldMale 'boy' 'girl'>> brutally kills <<worldMale 'him' 'her'>>, burns the court, and returns to a <<worldFemale 'girl' 'boy'>> who does not know what happened. They make love the same night.
	<br><br>
	With each act, the book becomes darker and scarier. Every time you read it, you envision an innocent, pure <<worldFemale 'girl' 'boy'>> in a white dress and <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> dangerous and lustful <<worldMale 'lad' 'lass'>>. You feel a mix of jealousy, lust, and anger. And you like it.
	<br><br>
	<<if currentSkillValue('english') gte 600 and $arousal gte ($arousalmax * 2/5)>>
		당신은 더 이상 단순히 책을 읽는 것이 아니다. 모든 장면과 감정이 너무나 완벽하게 묘사되어, 마치 그곳에 있는 것처럼, 그들 중 하나가 된 것처럼 선명하게 느낀다.
		<br><br>
	<<else>>
		당신은 이 책이 가장 좋아하는 책 중 하나가 될 것이라 생각한다. 앞으로 더 자주 이 책을 다시 읽을 계획이다.
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
	<<if $scarletBook gte 5>>
		<span class="pink">책을 끝까지 다 읽었다.</span>
		<br><br>
	<<else>>
		<<scarleticon>><<link [[계속 읽는다 (0:20)|ScarletBook4]]>><<pass 20>><<englishskill>><<arousal 600>><</link>><<genglish>><<garousal>>
