		<</if>>
	<</if>>
	<<if currentSkillValue('english') gte 600 and ($arousal gte ($arousalmax * 2/5) or $scarletBook gte 5)>>
		<<daydreamicon>><<link [[Imagine yourself as Janet|ScarletBook5]]>><<handheldon>><<pass 30>><<arousal 600>><<tiredness -1.5>><</link>><<garousal>><<ltiredness>>
